{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803060/extras/30aed485d5a81d571751545854459541.apng?t=1769870078\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803060/extras/30aed485d5a81d571751545854459541.poster.avif?t=1769870078\" class=\"bb_img\" width=224 height=64 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something has gone wrong in this town. People live by habit: work, the store, bills - day after day. They have long forgotten what they once dreamed of in childhood and seem to have made peace with it. Something lurks here, slowly draining people of joy and hope. Can you change that?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803060/extras/fc25945c42c48268557ad277e299283f.poster.avif?t=1769870078\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803060/extras/fc25945c42c48268557ad277e299283f.webm?t=1769870078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803060/extras/fc25945c42c48268557ad277e299283f.mp4?t=1769870078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803060/extras/fb7a94f409d30c0392da3e43c959bee8.apng?t=1769870078\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803060/extras/fb7a94f409d30c0392da3e43c959bee8.poster.avif?t=1769870078\" class=\"bb_img\" width=384 height=60 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to characters and make choices - your decisions influence what happens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span 